@startuml
title Agentic IDE - Genel Sistem Use Case Görünümü
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Geliştirici" as Developer
actor "Bulut Model Sağlayıcı\n(Claude API)" as CloudModel
actor "Yerel Model Sağlayıcı\n(Ollama)" as LocalModel
actor "Dosya Sistemi" as FileSystem
actor "Bağlam ve İndeks Servisi\n(Embedding + Symbol Retrieval)" as ContextService
actor "Tercih Deposu\n(preferences.json)" as PreferenceStore
actor "Audit Log\n(audit.jsonl)" as AuditLog

rectangle "Agentic IDE" {
  usecase "Proje klasörü aç" as UC_OpenProject
  usecase "Çalışma alanını indeksle" as UC_IndexWorkspace
  usecase "Dosya görüntüle ve düzenle" as UC_EditFiles
  usecase "Doğal dil ile görev başlat" as UC_StartTask
  usecase "Kod tabanını açıkla\n(Q&A)" as UC_CodebaseQA
  usecase "Hata tespiti ve\ndüzeltme planı iste" as UC_BugFix
  usecase "Çok dosyalı refactor iste" as UC_Refactor
  usecase "Test oluşturma iste" as UC_TestGen
  usecase "Güvenli tek dosya\ndüzenleme iste" as UC_SafeEdit
  usecase "Bağlam kaynaklarını göster" as UC_ShowSources
  usecase "Diff incele" as UC_ReviewDiff
  usecase "Değişikliği onayla / reddet" as UC_ApproveReject
  usecase "Seçerek uygula" as UC_PartialApply
  usecase "Rollback yap" as UC_Rollback
  usecase "Model tercihini ayarla" as UC_SelectModel
  usecase "Gizlilik tercihini ayarla" as UC_PrivacyPreference
  usecase "Reactive safety warning göster\n(apply öncesi)" as UC_ReactiveSafetyWarning
  usecase "Audit geçmişini incele" as UC_ViewAudit
  usecase "İlgili dosyaları retrieve et" as UC_RetrieveContext
  usecase "Değişiklik planı oluştur" as UC_CreatePlan
}

Developer --> UC_OpenProject
Developer --> UC_EditFiles
Developer --> UC_StartTask
Developer --> UC_ReviewDiff
Developer --> UC_ApproveReject
Developer --> UC_Rollback
Developer --> UC_SelectModel
Developer --> UC_PrivacyPreference
Developer --> UC_ViewAudit

UC_OpenProject .> UC_IndexWorkspace : <<include>>
UC_StartTask .> UC_RetrieveContext : <<include>>
UC_StartTask .> UC_CreatePlan : <<include>>
UC_StartTask .> UC_ShowSources : <<include>>
UC_StartTask .> UC_ReactiveSafetyWarning : <<include>>
UC_BugFix -|> UC_StartTask
UC_Refactor -|> UC_StartTask
UC_TestGen -|> UC_StartTask
UC_CodebaseQA -|> UC_StartTask
UC_SafeEdit -|> UC_StartTask
UC_ApproveReject .> UC_ReviewDiff : <<include>>
UC_PartialApply .> UC_ApproveReject : <<extend>>
UC_Rollback .> UC_ViewAudit : <<include>>

ContextService --> UC_IndexWorkspace
ContextService --> UC_RetrieveContext
CloudModel --> UC_CreatePlan
LocalModel --> UC_CreatePlan
FileSystem --> UC_OpenProject
FileSystem --> UC_EditFiles
FileSystem --> UC_ReviewDiff
FileSystem --> UC_Rollback
PreferenceStore --> UC_SelectModel
PreferenceStore --> UC_PrivacyPreference
AuditLog --> UC_ViewAudit
AuditLog --> UC_ApproveReject
AuditLog --> UC_Rollback
AuditLog --> UC_ReactiveSafetyWarning

note right of UC_StartTask
MVP görev ailesi:
- bug fix
- refactor
- test oluşturma
- Q&A
- tek dosya güvenli edit
end note

note bottom of UC_ApproveReject
Plan-first, approval-gated model:
Kullanıcı onayı olmadan hiçbir dosya yazılmaz.
end note

note bottom of UC_PrivacyPreference
Kullanıcı bulut modeli veya yalnızca yerel modeli
tercih ederek veri çıkışını kontrol eder.
end note

note bottom of UC_ReactiveSafetyWarning
MVP içi reactive safety: yalnızca apply öncesi.
Tetikleyiciler: workspace boundary violation,
protected file write, large edit threshold,
secret-in-diff. Detay: UC-03A.
Background scanning MVP DIŞIDIR (UC-03B).
end note

@enduml